OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FWarning: Article contains distressing
OL,7,Fdetails
OL,9,FA woman whose unborn baby's body was
OL,10,Fleft in a paper bag on the floor of a
OL,11,Ffuneral parlour sobbed as she told the
OL,12,Fowner: "I trusted you with the most
OL,13,Fprecious person in my life."
OL,15,FJasmine Beverley said she chose to use
OL,16,FLegacy Independent Funeral Directors,
OL,17,Frun by Robert Bush, when her son Sunny
OL,18,FBeverley-Conlin was "born sleeping" in
OL,19,FMay 2022.
OL,26,@tD@HOUuD@\O]zD@UOUzD@cO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FHull Crown Court heard Ms Beverley and
OL,7,Fher partner Ben chose Bush because she
OL,8,Fhad previously used him for her
OL,9,Ffather's funeral.
OL,11,FBush is facing sentencing after
OL,12,Fadmitting 67 charges following the
OL,13,Fdiscovery of 35 bodies and ashes at
OL,14,Fhis premises in Hull.
OL,16,FMs Beverley told the court: "My son
OL,17,FSunny was born sleeping, but he was
OL,18,Floved long before he entered this
OL,19,Fworld and he will be loved for the
OL,20,Frest of my life.
OL,26,@xD@]OU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,F"When a parent loses a baby, all they
OL,7,Fhope for is that their child will be
OL,8,Ftreated with dignity, care and respect.
OL,10,F"That is why we place enormous trust
OL,11,Fin the people responsible for caring
OL,12,Ffor our loved ones after death."
OL,14,FShe turned to face Bush in the dock,
OL,15,Fwho showed no emotion as she told him:
OL,16,F"I trusted you with the most precious
OL,17,Fperson in my life."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUtD@`O]xD@AOUyD@SO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FThe court heard the couple visited
OL,7,FSunny at Legacy on 16 June and left
OL,8,Fhim a photograph of the family, a blue
OL,9,Ffleece blanket and some flowers.
OL,11,FA small service took place a day
OL,12,Flater, at Legacy's chapel, and the
OL,13,Fcouple understood that Sunny was to be
OL,14,Fcremated at Chanterlands Avenue
OL,15,FCrematorium.
OL,17,FThey collected his ashes on 30 March,
OL,18,Fwhen Bush handed them the little blue
OL,19,Fcoffin and told them that Sunny's
OL,20,Fashes were inside in an envelope, the
OL,21,Fcourt heard.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FSunny's remains were recovered at
OL,7,FLegacy almost two years after he was
OL,8,Fborn, when a police officer found them
OL,9,Fin a brown paper bag on the floor.
OL,11,FMs Beverley sobbed as she said: "When
OL,12,FI discovered what had happened, it
OL,13,Freopened that trauma in a way I cannot
OL,14,Ffully describe.
OL,16,F"It felt like being pulled back into
OL,17,Fthe darkest time of my life. The
OL,18,Fgrief, anxiety and distress returned
OL,19,Fwith such intensity that I again found
OL,20,Fmyself struggling mentally and
OL,21,Femotionally."
OL,26,@sD@aOUxD@AOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FShe told Bush: "Your actions have
OL,7,Ftaken away something that can never be
OL,8,Freplaced: the peace of believing our
OL,9,Floved ones were treated with care and
OL,10,Frespect after death.
OL,12,F"The reality I now live with is that
OL,13,Fmy baby boy Sunny has spent more time
OL,14,Fin your possession than he ever did
OL,15,Fwith his own family.
OL,17,F"I have to live with the fact that my
OL,18,Fson was kept for so long without my
OL,19,Fknowledge, and that when he was
OL,20,Feventually found he was in a brown
OL,21,Fpaper bag on the floor.
OL,26,@nD@POUtD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,F"As a mother, that is something that
OL,7,Fwill stay with me for the rest of my
OL,8,Flife."
OL,10,FSusie Beever, reporting from Hull
OL,12,FIt's been another emotional day in
OL,13,FHull Crown Court, where Robert Bush
OL,14,Fsat sullenly as he was told he had
OL,15,Fbroken people's trust, that victims
OL,16,Fwere disgusted and that he had taken
OL,17,Fadvantage of them in the midst of
OL,18,Fgrief.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@FO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/21
