OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FThe past two days have laid bare the
OL,7,Fhuge impact of Bush's crimes, the
OL,8,Fguilt and unanswered questions victims
OL,9,Fhave been left with and the lasting
OL,10,Ftrauma his actions have caused.
OL,12,FHearing the testimonies of four women
OL,13,Fwho trusted Bush to arrange proper
OL,14,Ffunerals for their unborn babies made
OL,15,Ffor difficult listening for many in
OL,16,Fthe court.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G8/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FMother Jasmine Beverley turned to face
OL,7,FBush directly at one point, telling
OL,8,Fhim through tears how his actions had
OL,9,F"taken away something that can never
OL,10,Fbe replaced".
OL,12,FBush's eyes, meanwhile, remained fixed
OL,13,Fon the floor of the dock.
OL,15,FMs Beverley was one of four women
OL,16,Fgiven the wrong ashes after trusting
OL,17,FBush with the cremations of their
OL,18,Funborn babies.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G9/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
