OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FAll four gave emotional statements in
OL,7,Fcourt on Tuesday. Lucy Ness said she
OL,8,Fhad been left with "nothing but an
OL,9,Fempty bag" to remind her of her child.
OL,11,FEarlier on in the day, a grieving
OL,12,Fdaughter said the horrors at Bush's
OL,13,Ffuneral parlour made her think of
OL,14,F"bodies found in Auschwitz", while
OL,15,Fanother described the fraudster
OL,16,Ftreating her "lovely" father "like a
OL,17,Fpiece of meat".
OL,26,@pD@TOUqD@JO]vD@AOUvD@[O]xD@NOUxD@UO]xD@
OL,26,A^OUyD@NO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G10/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33111
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FThe court heard how Bush was a "cruel
OL,7,Fconman" who "fooled a lot of people in
OL,8,FHull with his mild manner" while using
OL,9,Ftheir grief to fund his lifestyle.
OL,11,FBush, 48, is to be sentenced for 67
OL,12,Foffences spanning 12 years and
OL,13,Faffecting hundreds of victims.
OL,15,FHull Crown Court heard how he kept 31
OL,16,Fbodies at his funeral home while
OL,17,Ffalsely telling their families they
OL,18,Fhad been cremated and giving them the
OL,19,Fashes of a stranger.
OL,26,@nD@`OUoD@GO]oD@MOUpD@ZO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G11/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33112
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FAs the second day of the sentencing
OL,7,Fhearing got under way on Tuesday, the
OL,8,Fcourt heard how the family of Jim
OL,9,FPorter, 80, whose body was recovered
OL,10,Ffrom Legacy with his hospital
OL,11,Fidentification bands still on his
OL,12,Fwrists and ankle, noticed at his
OL,13,Ffuneral that his coffin did not look
OL,14,Fbig enough for him.
OL,16,FHis daughter Tina Thames said: "Dad
OL,17,Ftold me and my brother and sister that
OL,18,Fhe didn't want a fancy or expensive
OL,19,Ffuneral.
OL,26,@xD@`OU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G12/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33113
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,F"He just wanted us to celebrate his
OL,7,Flife.
OL,9,F"Legacy Independent Funeral Directors
OL,10,Fwere a local firm and offered a
OL,11,Freasonably priced service.
OL,13,F"It seemed a good choice for us. How
OL,14,Fwrong we were."
OL,16,FShe went on to say: "When the police
OL,17,Ftold me there was a possibility that
OL,18,Fdad was still at Legacy, I was
OL,19,Fdevastated.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@AOUuD@AOUvD@OO]xD@UOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G13/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33114
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,F"I had nightmares and thoughts of
OL,7,Fbodies just piled up came into my mind.
OL,9,F"The only way I can describe it is
OL,10,Flike seeing images of the bodies found
OL,11,Fin Auschwitz during the war."
OL,13,FThe court also heard from the family
OL,14,Fof Terry White, 73, whose body was
OL,15,Frecovered from Legacy more than two
OL,16,Fmonths after his death on Christmas
OL,17,FEve 2023.
OL,19,FHis family collected ashes from
OL,20,FLegacy, which were in a box with a
OL,21,FChanterlands Crematorium label.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@AOUsD@]O]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G14/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33115
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FBut when Mr White's daughter Angela
OL,7,FScottow contacted the crematorium to
OL,8,Fask for a plot near her sister's,
OL,9,Fstaff said they had no record of him
OL,10,Fbeing cremated there.
OL,12,FMs Scottow's victim impact statement
OL,13,Fsaid: "Dad was such a lovely man and
OL,14,FRobert Bush treated him like a piece
OL,15,Fof meat."
OL,26,@uD@GOUwD@IO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G15/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33116
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FAs well as the bodies found at Legacy,
OL,7,Fthe court heard Bush committed fraud
OL,8,Fin relation to 57 sets of ashes `
OL,9,Fincluding 46 families who were given
OL,10,Fthe wrong ashes, and 11 families who
OL,11,Fwere never given any at all.
OL,13,FProsecutor Chris Paxton KC said the
OL,14,Ftotal monetary value of this fraud was
OL,15,F#86,868.
OL,17,FAmong these was Alan Chearman, whose
OL,18,Ffamily collected his ashes on 26 July
OL,19,F2022, wanting to scatter them on that
OL,20,Fday as it was the anniversary of his
OL,21,Fson's death.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G16/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33117
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FRecords showed he was not cremated
OL,7,Funtil August that year, and Bush did
OL,8,Fnot collect the ashes until October.
OL,10,FWhen police searched the Legacy site
OL,11,Fthey seized a box with a sticker on
OL,12,Fwhich read: "Woodland's crematorium `
OL,13,Fcremated remains of the late Alan
OL,14,FChearman."
OL,16,FHis widow Shelley Chearman looked
OL,17,Ftowards Bush in court as she told him:
OL,18,F"You fooled a lot of people in Hull
OL,19,Fwith your mild manner, when in fact
OL,20,Fyou are a cruel conman. You use
OL,21,Fpeople's grief to fund your lifestyle."
OL,26,@tD@MOUvD@JO]zD@AOU}D@gO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G17/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33118
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FThe court heard that over 11 years
OL,7,FBush also defrauded 226 people who
OL,8,Fpaid him for funeral plans, pocketing
OL,9,Fmore than #500,000.
OL,11,FProsecutor Chris Paxton KC said none
OL,12,Fof these funeral plans were referred
OL,13,Fto a third-party insurer and money
OL,14,Fpaid for them was transferred into
OL,15,FBush and his wife's personal accounts.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G18/21
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33119
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785257280
OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FThe court heard a total of #562,117
OL,7,Fwas paid to Legacy by those believing
OL,8,Fthat the money was being invested into
OL,9,Fa legitimate funeral policy, many of
OL,10,Fwhich were taken out by parents, so
OL,11,Fthat their children did not have to
OL,12,Fpay for their funerals.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G19/21
