OL,3,CMums who lost babies tell court of
OL,4,Ctrauma at being given wrong remains
OL,6,FHull Crown Court heard that over 12
OL,7,Fyears, Bush breached the trust placed
OL,8,Fin him by grieving families "on an
OL,9,Falmost industrial scale", by keeping
OL,10,Fbodies for months after they should
OL,11,Fhave been cremated, giving out the
OL,12,Fwrong ashes, taking money for funeral
OL,13,Fplans without making any of the
OL,14,Farrangements and stealing charity
OL,15,Fdonations collected at services.
OL,17,FIn April Bush pleaded guilty to 30
OL,18,Fcounts of preventing a lawful and
OL,19,Fdecent burial, and theft from 12
OL,20,Fcharities including the Salvation Army
OL,21,Fand Macmillan Cancer Support.
OL,26,@pD@]OUqD@XO]
